		AGMIMG_ySign?{ceiling 0.1 add}{floor 0.1 sub}ifelse exch
		AGMIMG_xSign?{ceiling 0.1 add}{floor 0.1 sub}ifelse exch
		itransform/AGMIMG_urY exch def/AGMIMG_urX exch def			
